          "status": "machine-unreviewed",
          "text": "Description: A witness reports in June 2011 an observation made on December 30, 2002: while watching a fireworks display, he notices in the sky a luminous phenomenon that he cannot explain; he sees a stationary white glowing circle spinning in one direction then the other. Only one testimony about this phenomenon was collected. The case, recently declared (08/06/2011), cannot give rise to an investigation. No other testimony can be cross-referenced with this one. Therefore, the case is classified C due to lack of information.",
